<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee weakens on dollar and pound.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee weakens on dollar and pound.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee weakened on both the dollar and pound on Monday, commercial dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee was fixed at a mean commercial rate of 20.539 versus the dollar from 20.527 last Friday. On the pound, the rupee was quoted at a mean of 33.0155 from 32.6975 on Friday.</p>
<p>Dealers said the Mauritian rupee's fixing was done in line with the dollar's current trend in international markets.</p>
